{"schema_version":"3.1","id":null,"category_id":"ALR-009","category_key":"soya_alerjisi","category_type":"food_allergy","category_name":"Soya Fasulyesi ve Soya Fasulyesi Ürünleri","regulatory_group":true,"version":"3.1.0","description_short":"Soya fasulyesindeki proteinlere karşı gelişebilen IgE-aracılı gıda alerjisi.","medical_context":"Soya alerjisi, soya fasulyesi proteinlerine karşı gelişen IgE-aracılı reaksiyonları kapsar. Gly m 5 (beta-konglisinin) ve Gly m 6 (glisinin) depo proteinlerine duyarlılık bazı çalışmalarda daha ağır sistemik reaksiyonlarla ilişkilendirilmiştir. Gly m 4, huş ağacı poleninin Bet v 1 alerjeni ile ilişkili PR-10 ailesinden bir soya alerjenidir ve polen ilişkili soya reaksiyonlarında rol oynayabilir. Alerjen bileşenlerine duyarlılık, bireysel reaksiyon şiddetini tek başına kesin olarak öngörmez.","regulatory_note":"Türk Gıda Kodeksi Gıda Etiketleme ve Tüketicileri Bilgilendirme Yönetmeliği Ek-1 kapsamında soya fasulyesi ve soya fasulyesi ürünleri alerjen bildirimi kapsamındadır. Mevzuatta tam rafine soya fasulyesi yağı, soya fasulyesinden elde edilen belirli tokoferoller, soya fasulyesi kaynaklı bitkisel yağlardan elde edilen belirli sterol ve sterol esterleri ile soya fasulyesi kaynaklı bitkisel sıvı yağ sterollerinden üretilen bitkisel stanol esteri için spesifik istisnalar bulunmaktadır. Bu istisnalar yalnız ilgili bileşen eşleşmesine uygulanır ve üründeki diğer soya kaynaklarını bastırmaz.","sources":[{"source_id":"TR-TGK-ETIKETLEME-EK1","source_type":"official_regulation","authority":"T.C. Tarım ve Orman Bakanlığı","title":"Türk Gıda Kodeksi Gıda Etiketleme ve Tüketicileri Bilgilendirme Yönetmeliği - Ek-1","jurisdiction":"TR","url":"https://istanbul.tarimorman.gov.tr/BelgelerArsiv/SolMenu/RESM%C4%B0%20GAZETE/GidaEtiketlemeYonetmeligi.pdf","accessed_at":"2026-09-12"},{"source_id":"TR-TGK-ETIKET-KILAVUZ-2026","source_type":"official_guidance","authority":"T.C. Tarım ve Orman Bakanlığı","title":"Türk Gıda Kodeksi Gıda Etiketleme ve Tüketicileri Bilgilendirme Yönetmeliği Kılavuzu","jurisdiction":"TR","url":"https://www.tarimorman.gov.tr/GKGM/Duyuru/681/","accessed_at":"2026-09-12"},{"source_id":"PUBMED-18996574","source_type":"peer_reviewed_article","authority":"Journal of Allergy and Clinical Immunology","title":"Soybean allergy in Europe: Gly m 5 and Gly m 6 are potential diagnostic markers for severe allergic reactions to soy","jurisdiction":"international","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/18996574/","accessed_at":"2026-09-12"},{"source_id":"PUBMED-35769564","source_type":"peer_reviewed_article","authority":"PubMed indexed literature","title":"Utility of the Basophil Activation Test Using Gly m 4, Gly m 5 and Gly m 6 Molecular Allergens for Characterizing Anaphylactic Reactions to Soy","jurisdiction":"international","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35769564/","accessed_at":"2026-09-12"},{"source_id":"PUBMED-11419717","source_type":"peer_reviewed_article","authority":"PubMed indexed literature","title":"Determination of the IgE-binding activity of soy lecithin and refined and non-refined soybean oils","jurisdiction":"international","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/11419717/","accessed_at":"2026-09-12"},{"source_id":"PUBMED-10024228","source_type":"peer_reviewed_article","authority":"Clinical and Experimental Allergy","title":"Antigenicity of the proteins in soy lecithin and soy oil in soybean allergy","jurisdiction":"international","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/10024228/","accessed_at":"2026-09-12"},{"source_id":"PUBMED-33537038","source_type":"peer_reviewed_article","authority":"PubMed indexed literature","title":"Effect of Planting Date and Cultivar Maturity in Edamame Quality and Harvest Window","jurisdiction":"international","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33537038/","accessed_at":"2026-09-12"},{"source_id":"PUBMED-14713921","source_type":"peer_reviewed_article","authority":"Journal of Allergy and Clinical Immunology","title":"Soybean allergy in patients allergic to birch pollen: clinical investigation and molecular characterization of allergens","jurisdiction":"international","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/14713921/","accessed_at":"2026-09-12"}],"search_rules":{"contains":[{"rule_id":"SOY-CON-001","keyword":"soya","aliases":["soy","soybean","soybeans"],"match_type":"whole_word","source_fields":["ingredients","product_name"],"context":{"required":[],"forbidden":[],"scope":"same_segment"},"decision":"contains","severity":"high","source_refs":["TR-TGK-ETIKET-KILAVUZ-2026"]},{"rule_id":"SOY-CON-002","keyword":"soya fasulyesi","aliases":[],"match_type":"exact_phrase","source_fields":["ingredients","product_name"],"context":{"required":[],"forbidden":[],"scope":"same_segment"},"decision":"contains","severity":"high","source_refs":["TR-TGK-ETIKET-KILAVUZ-2026"]},{"rule_id":"SOY-CON-003","keyword":"soya unu","aliases":[],"match_type":"exact_phrase","source_fields":["ingredients","product_name"],"context":{"required":[],"forbidden":[],"scope":"same_segment"},"decision":"contains","severity":"high","source_refs":["TR-TGK-ETIKET-KILAVUZ-2026"]},{"rule_id":"SOY-CON-004","keyword":"soya proteini","aliases":[],"match_type":"exact_phrase","source_fields":["ingredients","product_name"],"context":{"required":[],"forbidden":[],"scope":"same_segment"},"decision":"contains","severity":"high","source_refs":["TR-TGK-ETIKET-KILAVUZ-2026"]},{"rule_id":"SOY-CON-005","keyword":"tekstüre soya proteini","aliases":["tekstüre edilmiş soya proteini"],"match_type":"exact_phrase","source_fields":["ingredients","product_name"],"context":{"required":[],"forbidden":[],"scope":"same_segment"},"decision":"contains","severity":"high","source_refs":["TR-TGK-ETIKET-KILAVUZ-2026"]},{"rule_id":"SOY-CON-006","keyword":"soya proteini izolatı","aliases":["soya protein izolatı","izole soya proteini","soya izolatı"],"match_type":"exact_phrase","source_fields":["ingredients","product_name"],"context":{"required":[],"forbidden":[],"scope":"same_segment"},"dec